{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/253187-hunter-campaign-by-way-of-orpheus","id":253187,"title":"Hunter Campaign By Way of Orpheus","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-09T03:47:10-07:00","id":253187,"title":"Hunter Campaign By Way of Orpheus","content":"OK, wait! It's not what you think! <br /> <br /> I know there's been talk of Orpheus Conspiracies and Compacts for awhile now, but that's not what I'm talking about!<br /> <br /> Here's the thing: The Orpheus campaign was really well done. The storyline was fun and engaging. What I want to do is steal it. I want to take the ideas for the different twists and turns of the series and make it into a Hunter campaign instead.<br /> <br /> Basically, Hunters would be open about what they do. There's a rise in &quot;sightings&quot;, Hunters investigate and, if needed, eliminate the occurrence. They do this as a public company, they don't hide what they do, though most people think they're just con men and crackpots. The company the PCs will work for is called Orion.<br /> <br /> Obviously, I wouldn't be using the Underworld. I'm thinking of making something up, like, The Nightmare Lands, or something, where the Monsters come from.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1101-blindst","name":"blindST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T04:07:32-07:00","id":253215,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I'm thinking of making something up, like, The Nightmare Lands, or something, where the Monsters come from. </div> </div> </div>Well, maybe you should wait for Beast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T04:37:14-07:00","id":253225,"title":"","content":"Beast? Is that, like, the campaign book for Hunter or something? Or is it more like Midian? You know about Midian right? It's where the Monsters come from...:P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1101-blindst","name":"blindST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T05:07:25-07:00","id":253238,"title":"","content":"Beast: The Primordial, a newly announced line. Little is known at this point, but it's supposed to draw inspiration in from those all monster related folk/fairy tales.<br /> <br /> That is why I said it might be good idea to wait for it since I expect plethora of cool stuff, especially as it's meant to be customization friendly. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-10T03:59:49-07:00","id":253960,"title":"","content":"Couple of questions: First, when is Beast supposed to be released? Besides 2015 I mean. Second, while it sounds neat, didn't they do the whole Fairy Tales thing with, um, Changeling? I'm not crazy here am I?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1101-blindst","name":"blindST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-10T11:34:08-07:00","id":254244,"title":"","content":"Beast is going to allow you to make reasonably crossover friendly &quot;beasts&quot; that can range from wendigo to creature from the black lagoon to pinhead I believe, and dragons. They are the stuff of fear, plain and simple...I think. So wherever they come from, is where fear makes monsters...again, I think.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedat